<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">To {!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><div style="">As we have not received a response on our previous attempts to contact you regarding payment options, we wanted to provide you with a settlement offer prior to incurring additional fees through litigation.</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">The current amount due on your purchase and sale of future receivables agreement is {!advpm__Matter__c.Total_Amount_Charged_Off__c}. At this time, we are able to offer you the following monthly payment plan on the amount due:&nbsp;</div><div style=""><br></div><div style=""><span style="white-space:pre">	</span>- Twelve (12) monthly payments of&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt;">{!advpm__Matter__c.Settlement_Offer_12_Months__c}</span></div></font><font face="arial" style=""><div style=""><br></div><div style="">If you wish to take advantage of this payment plan, please reach out to us to set up.&nbsp;</div><div style=""><br></div><div style="">If you are unable to pay the above settlement amount, but still want to resolve prior to litigation, please reach out to us via phone or email.</div></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney__c} | {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>{!advpm__Matter__c.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">P: {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">E: {!advpm__Matter__c.Lead_Attorney_Email__c}</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>